    "49b90e0f-f7bf-49e7-9d59-0bfc98201d38": {
      "type": "multirow",
      "blocks": {
        "template--16192093028523__49b90e0f-f7bf-49e7-9d59-0bfc98201d38-row-1": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/black_and_white_image_of_a_women_in_white_shirt.webp",
            "caption": "",
            "heading": "Sustainability & Self Love",
            "text": "<p>We believe human health and the health of the planet are interconnected. Therefore, to look after ourselves we must live in harmony with mother earth, Papatūānuku. In a world full of misinformation and isolation, we must question convention and reconnect with our heart, intuition and each other. When creating and sourcing our products, we consider the full life cycle of a product and continually innovate to find better solutions. Through this process we embody the change we want to see in the world and can educate and inspire others so that they can do the same.<br/><br/>Self-love is self-care. The greatest thing we can do for the people around us is to learn to truly love and look after ourselves. Tea and Tonic is home to an abundance of beautiful products to inspire the creation of daily rituals and sacred spaces. It is the perfect place to curate a gift to yourself or another, encouraging this act of love in action. In the modern world it is so important to find time to retreat and to nurture our mental, emotional, spiritual and physical well-being. We must learn to love ourselves first before we can truly love another.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "template--16192093028523__49b90e0f-f7bf-49e7-9d59-0bfc98201d38-row-2": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/monni_in_black_jumpsuit.webp",
            "caption": "",
            "heading": "Empowering Women & The Art Of Gifting",
            "text": "<p>Empowering women is essential to the health and social development of families, communities and countries. That is why we align with woman-owned businesses who are contributing to make the world a better place. By doing so, we empower these women so that they can reach their full potential and support sustainable economic growth and social transformation.<br/><br/>Our lives are fulfilling when we give and share — great inner joy comes from helping others to better their lives. Giving provides an intrinsic reward that is far more valuable than the gift we receive. Giving can be a joyous experience and one that does not come at a cost to the environment. That’s why we’ve curated the most beautiful, sustainable, locally sourced, plastic-free products just for you, and wrapped them with care in biodegradable packaging. We also offer sustainable gift boxes that are perfect for every occasion and loved one.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        }
      },
