    "4f0b02c9-df22-4d8c-98d9-3213a19711d7": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "template--16192093028523__4f0b02c9-df22-4d8c-98d9-3213a19711d7-heading-1": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Founder of Tea & Tonic",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "template--16192093028523__4f0b02c9-df22-4d8c-98d9-3213a19711d7-text-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Hello, it's me Monni.<br/><br/>Rather than give you the generic \"where I am from\" etc, I want to say: I am human, as are you. I am energy, as are you and every single thing that makes up our infinite universe.<br/><br/>We reflect each other and learn together on this journey, all made from the same. We are all connected, and deep down we all want to feel love, to feel accepted, to feel we belong. At Tea & Tonic, we stand for creating a culture where these values are at the core of everything we do.<br/><br/>We all know what it feels like to not feel enough, to not feel accepted, to not feel seen for who we are — even to feel like we do not belong. Yet we are here now, living this life in this body and although it may not always feel like it, this is truly a gift.<br/><br/>Know this: you are not your thoughts. You are truly unique. There is not one single person in the world like you. This world needs you to be here. You are already conscious of your power to be the change you wish to see in the world.<br/><br/>Experiencing past trauma has driven my own personal journey to self love and acceptance. We all have trauma to a degree, it is all relative. It is how you choose to look at your life now, and what you do in this moment, and each and every moment moving forward, that will define your story.<br/><br/>Imagine if you had not experienced all you have up until this point in time: you would not be everything that you are. If we can see how all our challenges are gifts in disguise, we can realise our true and best self and the divinity in every moment.<br/><br/>Forget \"should\" and \"should not\", labels and conditioning. Deep down, you know and you will always know what is true for you. Trust this!<br/><br/>Never stop imagining anything is possible!<br/>What is the most true and beautiful life you could imagine?<br/><br/>Wishing you a true and beautiful day…<br/><br/>Love,<br/>Monni</p>"
          }
        }
      },
